e is a conman  is only one aspect of his character if  you hate Reagan because he is a shady  con man and that is the entire extent of  take on the character you are only  scratching the surface of who Reagan  really is it's true that Reagan left his  job as a regular salary man to start a  supernatural consulting agency even  though he had no psychic powers of his  own at first he was basically a masseuse  he massaged his clients as part of what  he calls a spiritual cleansing and with  many clients this procedure actually  held them feel better this is because in  many cases the clients that came to  Reagan weren't really dealing with evil  spirits or curses the only thought that  they were so Reagan's spiritual  cleansing served as a placebo the  clients thinking that the evil spirit or  curse had been removed started to feel  better even though there were no spirits  or curses in the first place despite his  obvious shadiness Reagan is driven by  the desire to change the world for the  better to make a difference and this has  been his desire ever since he was a  student by starting his own business he  wanted to do more good than he could as  a regular salary man but he quickly  realized that he was just a glorified  masseuse and he was about to abandon his  agency until a young mob came to ask him  for help  mob heard about the agency and came to  Reagan because mob was struggling to  come to terms with his own psychic  abilities and believing that Reagan also  had the same type of power mob was  hoping that Reagan could help him  control them better at first Reagan  think that mob is just a troubled kid  with an overactive imagination  but he still feels bad for him however  Reagan soon realizes that mob really  does have psychic powers and so instead  of abandoning the agency Reagan decides  to use mobs incredible powers to deal  with real spirits and with other  supernatural threats despite the fact  that he started off as a con artist  Reagan isn't just a 